WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.535
Ten steps.

2
00:00:01.535 --> 00:00:04.040
Steps 1 to 4 make the dark box.

3
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:08.100
Steps 5 to 10 put the orange front plate on it, with the shutter,

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.508
the wheel and the lens.

5
00:00:10.058 --> 00:00:11.298
Build step one.

6
00:00:11.298 --> 00:00:14.283
Take the spool, the part with the red winder.

7
00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:19.353
Lower it, winder up, into the round chamber on the right, seen from behind.

8
00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:22.303
Its plain end goes into the slot in the floor,

9
00:00:22.303 --> 00:00:25.105
and the winder's neck into the slot in the roof.

10
00:00:25.105 --> 00:00:29.035
Check it: the red winder sits on top of the camera and turns.

11
00:00:29.035 --> 00:00:32.860
The spool, its axle and its winder are one piece,

12
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.541
because this part takes the most turning force.

